    "title": "Elias, No. 5 Shore roll past Monmouth in dominant performance - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Becker ,\n34 minutes ago Shore, No. 5 in the NJ.com Top 20, defeated Monmouth 14-0 in West Long Branch behind five goals from Briella Elias. Shore scored seven goals in the first quarter and kept its foot on the gas the rest of the way. Marielle Montenegro and Emma Haynes each added two goals. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
